        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obobani igoro ya Turo na Sidoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya naro amang’ana igoro ya Turo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inwe abe chimeeri chia Tarisisi, rera, ekiagera Turo osarigwe, chinyomba tichiyo, gose ekiambokero. Abanto b’ense ya Kuporo baabamanyirie amang’ana ayio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abamomenyete ase egesinka, tegerera mokire‐kiri! Abaonchoreria ba Sidoni, abwo bagotaara ne chimeeri, kare nigo baichorete ase ense yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo bataarete ase chinyancha chinene, na ebitoki biaino nigo biarenge chimbusuro chia Sihori, na okwama kwe riranya ri’Orooche rwa Naeli. Ninwe mwarenge abaonchoreria b’ebisaku bionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Sidoni, rora obosooku; enyancha ere neburi enkong’u y’enyancha yatebiire iga: “Inche tinana kobina, gose koibora, tinana korera abana abamura, gose gokinia abaiseke abekungi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abamisiri baraigwe amang’ana ayio igoro ya Turo, nigo baraichane mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abamomenyete ase egesinka, amboka, mogende Tarisisi, morere!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Oyo nomochie oria oino oichire nomogooko, omochie oyio oagachetwe ase chingaki chia kare, oyio amagoro ’abaanto baye abogoretie gochia komenya ase chinse chi’aare?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ning’o oroberetie amang’ana aya onsi mamincha ya Turo? Omochie oyio orenge kobekera abarwoti chigutwa, na abaonchoreria baye nigo baarenge abagaambi, na abaoonia baye nigo basikire ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene bw’Emeganda nere oroberetie ayio ase okoiyeria inse oboenenu bw’obonene na gochaaya abanene bonsi b’ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abanto ba Tarisisi, menteka, moichore ase ense yaino, mobe buna amaache ’orooche rwa Naeli; kende tikeri kerabatange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene oramboire okoboko kwaye igoro y’enyancha, onyegeirie amarwoti; orure ogochika igoro ya Kaanani ng’a chiburi chiaye chitagorwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere agateeba, “Aye omochie o Sidoni orenge buna omoiseke omwekuungi, korende bono gwakoreirwe bobe, tokonyara koba nomogooko naende. Imoka ogende Kuporo, nonya naroro tokonyara gotimoka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rigereria ense y’Abakalidayo! Abanto aba tibaarenge egesaku. Abaasuri nabwo barentete ching’iti chi’orosana komenya aroro. Abwo bakaagacha chindwaki chi’okoboera, bakaonchorana chinyomba chi’obogaambi. Chi’omochie oyio, bakayotagora okaba etui.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abe chimeeri chia Tarisisi rera, ekiagera chiburi chiaino chiatagoirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase amatuko ayio omochie o Turo mbwebwe ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo etano na ebere, emiaka ereng’aine ey’obogima bw’omorwoti oyomo. Emiaka eyio emerongo etano na ebere ekoera, neebe ase Turo buna ariikire ase ogoteera kw’omotayayi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye omokungu omotayayi konya kwebirwe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "imokia obokano, oetanane ase omochie bwonsi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "otere neriogi rigiya, otere amatera amange,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "erio nario orainyorwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiaka eyio emerongo etano na ebere koyaerire, Omonene nachiche korora omochie o Turo; omochie oyio noiranere chingencho chiaye chinkoro, ochake gokora obonyaka amo namarwoti onsi are ase ense.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebikonyorekana korwa ase oboonchoreria bwaye, na ebitoki bi’ogokora kwaye kw’obonyaka mbiatananwe ase Omonene, tibigosangererigwa na kogachwa. Ebio banyorire ase oboonchoreria nigo biranyorere abanto abwo bamenyete ase obosio vw’Omonene endagera eisaine, ne chianga chingiya chikobekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
